   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Public brand site + product catalogue + technical resource centre + lead engine, modelled on williamsrefrigeration.co.in.   Owner: platform eng   Rev 1.0   2026-10-07\nDesign stance: this is a read-heavy, low-write, SEO-critical B2B site. The scaling risk is NOT queries per second \u2014 it is content velocity, crawlability and never dropping an enquiry. So: cheap and boring today, with the seams pre-cut where the next 10x actually lands.",
   "originalText": "Public brand site + product catalogue + technical resource centre + lead engine, modelled on williamsrefrigeration.co.in.   Owner: platform eng   Rev 1.0   2026-10-07\nDesign stance: this is a read-heavy, low-write, SEO-critical B2B site. The scaling risk is NOT queries per second \u2014 it is content velocity, crawlability and never dropping an enquiry. So: cheap and boring today, with the seams pre-cut where the next 10x actually lands.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
