   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0188",
   "seed": 1541341035,
   "versionNonce": 893763898,
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2202.1600000000003,
   "width": 1440.0,
   "height": 300,
   "strokeColor": "#b08900",
   "backgroundColor": "#fffbea",
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0189",
   "seed": 424874190,
   "versionNonce": 1675534735,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 14,
   "y": 2216.1600000000003,
   "width": 1412.0,
   "height": 20.74,
   "strokeColor": "#1a1d23",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "A \u00b7 Lead capture \u2014 zero tolerance for a dropped enquiry",
   "originalText": "A \u00b7 Lead capture \u2014 zero tolerance for a dropped enquiry",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.22,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 13.600000000000001
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0190",
   "seed": 304831585,
   "versionNonce": 892949567,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 14,
   "y": 2244.9,
   "width": 1412.0,
   "height": 213.0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "1   POST /v1/leads   with Idempotency-Key (collapses double-clicks + client retries)\n2   Edge: Turnstile score + honeypot + time-to-fill + per-IP Redis bucket\n3   Validate, normalise phone/email, hash the IP (abuse only, never stored raw)\n4   ONE Postgres transaction:   INSERT lead  +  INSERT lead_item[]  +  INSERT outbox('lead.created')\n5   Respond 202 with lead_ref \u2014 the user sees success in under 300 ms\n6   Worker drains outbox -> email to sales + ack to customer + CRM upsert + WhatsApp ping\n7   CRM or mail provider down? The row stays in outbox. Exponential retry, then DLQ + page.\n\nWHY: the database commit is the durability boundary, and no third party sits on the\nuser's request path. A SaaS outage delays notification; it never loses the lead.\nVerification: a synthetic lead is submitted every 5 minutes end to end, and an alert\nfires on zero real leads during a business hour \u2014 silent form failure is the expensive bug.",
   "originalText": "1   POST /v1/leads   with Idempotency-Key (collapses double-clicks + client retries)\n2   Edge: Turnstile score + honeypot + time-to-fill + per-IP Redis bucket\n3   Validate, normalise phone/email, hash the IP (abuse only, never stored raw)\n4   ONE Postgres transaction:   INSERT lead  +  INSERT lead_item[]  +  INSERT outbox('lead.created')\n5   Respond 202 with lead_ref \u2014 the user sees success in under 300 ms\n6   Worker drains outbox -> email to sales + ack to customer + CRM upsert + WhatsApp ping\n7   CRM or mail provider down? The row stays in outbox. Exponential retry, then DLQ + page.\n\nWHY: the database commit is the durability boundary, and no third party sits on the\nuser's request path. A SaaS outage delays notification; it never loses the lead.\nVerification: a synthetic lead is submitted every 5 minutes end to end, and an alert\nfires on zero real leads during a business hour \u2014 silent form failure is the expensive bug.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.42,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 10.0
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0191",
   "seed": 1505396162,
   "versionNonce": 1483973954,
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1480.0,
   "y": 2202.1600000000003,
   "width": 1440.0,
   "height": 300,
   "strokeColor": "#b08900",
   "backgroundColor": "#fffbea",
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0192",
   "seed": 331446030,
   "versionNonce": 1705378817,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1494.0,
   "y": 2216.1600000000003,
   "width": 1412.0,
   "height": 20.74,
   "strokeColor": "#1a1d23",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "B \u00b7 Publish \u2014 editor click to live page, p95 under 30 s",
   "originalText": "B \u00b7 Publish \u2014 editor click to live page, p95 under 30 s",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.22,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 13.600000000000001
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0193",
   "seed": 1649067632,
   "versionNonce": 873304039,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1494.0,
   "y": 2244.9,
   "width": 1412.0,
   "height": 213.0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "1   Editor saves -> content_revision row (draft, full JSONB snapshot); media via signed PUT to S3\n2   Publish -> txn:  UPDATE product SET status='live', version=version+1  +  outbox('catalog.changed')\n3   Indexer bulk-upserts the changed documents into OpenSearch (1 s debounce)\n4   Purge worker: CDN surrogate-key purge  +  Next.js revalidateTag('product:<id>')\n5   Sitemap diff regenerated per locale, IndexNow ping to Google and Bing\n6   Rollback = publish the previous revision. No deploy, no DBA, no downtime.\n\nWHY tag-based purge and not a wildcard: a spec correction on one SKU must not cold-start\nthe whole catalogue and hand every visitor an origin round-trip. Each rendered page\ndeclares the entity tags it read, so invalidation is exactly as wide as the change.\nWHY a revision snapshot and not a diff: at ~20 publishes a week the storage is free and\n'restore exactly what was live on the day of the trade show' becomes a one-row operation.",
   "originalText": "1   Editor saves -> content_revision row (draft, full JSONB snapshot); media via signed PUT to S3\n2   Publish -> txn:  UPDATE product SET status='live', version=version+1  +  outbox('catalog.changed')\n3   Indexer bulk-upserts the changed documents into OpenSearch (1 s debounce)\n4   Purge worker: CDN surrogate-key purge  +  Next.js revalidateTag('product:<id>')\n5   Sitemap diff regenerated per locale, IndexNow ping to Google and Bing\n6   Rollback = publish the previous revision. No deploy, no DBA, no downtime.\n\nWHY tag-based purge and not a wildcard: a spec correction on one SKU must not cold-start\nthe whole catalogue and hand every visitor an origin round-trip. Each rendered page\ndeclares the entity tags it read, so invalidation is exactly as wide as the change.\nWHY a revision snapshot and not a diff: at ~20 publishes a week the storage is free and\n'restore exactly what was live on the day of the trade show' becomes a one-row operation.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.42,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 10.0
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
