   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0302",
   "seed": 969220956,
   "versionNonce": 1411849583,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2094.0,
   "y": 4167.800000000001,
   "width": 812.0,
   "height": 71.0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "Excellent when every access pattern is known up front and write scale is unbounded. We have neither. 'Products where\ncapacity > 600 L and refrigerant = R290, faceted by industry' is ad-hoc by nature, and the BI team needs joins. You\nwould pay in GSI sprawl, denormalisation and write-amplification for a workload of tens of writes per day. Right tool,\nwrong problem \u2014 and no SQL for analytics.",
   "originalText": "Excellent when every access pattern is known up front and write scale is unbounded. We have neither. 'Products where\ncapacity > 600 L and refrigerant = R290, faceted by industry' is ad-hoc by nature, and the BI team needs joins. You\nwould pay in GSI sprawl, denormalisation and write-amplification for a workload of tens of writes per day. Right tool,\nwrong problem \u2014 and no SQL for analytics.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.42,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 10.0
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0303",
   "seed": 1004116649,
   "versionNonce": 31273706,
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 1220.0,
   "y": 4346.280000000001,
   "width": 840.0,
   "height": 200,
   "strokeColor": "#e67700",
   "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf",
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0304",
   "seed": 66343599,
   "versionNonce": 334532991,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1234.0,
   "y": 4360.280000000001,
   "width": 812.0,
   "height": 19.52,
   "strokeColor": "#1a1d23",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "MySQL / Aurora MySQL \u2014 viable, not chosen",
   "originalText": "MySQL / Aurora MySQL \u2014 viable, not chosen",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.22,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 12.8
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0305",
   "seed": 400407702,
   "versionNonce": 1236051306,
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1234.0,
   "y": 4387.800000000001,
   "width": 812.0,
   "height": 71.0,
   "strokeColor": "#495057",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fontSize": 12.5,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "text": "This would genuinely work; it is not a bad answer. What it costs: GIN-indexed JSON containment, tsvector ranking,\nltree, PostGIS, pgvector, exclusion constraints, and Debezium-grade logical decoding. Every one of those is already on\nthe roadmap (specs, search, breadcrumbs, dealer map, semantic search, CDC). Pick MySQL only if the team's existing ops\nmuscle is MySQL \u2014 that reason beats this list.",
   "originalText": "This would genuinely work; it is not a bad answer. What it costs: GIN-indexed JSON containment, tsvector ranking,\nltree, PostGIS, pgvector, exclusion constraints, and Debezium-grade logical decoding. Every one of those is already on\nthe roadmap (specs, search, breadcrumbs, dealer map, semantic search, CDC). Pick MySQL only if the team's existing ops\nmuscle is MySQL \u2014 that reason beats this list.",
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.42,
   "autoResize": false,
   "baseline": 10.0
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "version": 1,
   "id": "el-0306",
   "seed": 272266808,
   "versionNonce": 1033642662,
   "type": "rectangle",
   "x": 2080.0,
   "y": 4346.280000000001,
   "width": 840.0,
   "height": 200,
   "strokeColor": "#c92a2a",
   "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3",
   "roundness": {
    "type": 3
   }
  },
  {
   "isDeleted": false,
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "boundElements": null,
